# XFCE desktop + LightDM display manager.
# The base recipe leaves the image headless; this profile adds everything
# needed to land at a graphical login screen.
xfce4
xfce4-goodies
lightdm
lightdm-gtk-greeter
xserver-xorg
xkb-data
# Audio. pipewire is the modern default on Debian trixie.
pipewire
wireplumber
pipewire-pulse
